  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I don't know who was in charge of this UI update, but it needs either a switch to the normal UI or a rollback, stat. It's awful, it's Roblox-esque, it's every-gacha-ever-esque, it's generic and it messes with the recognizable UI position (Like the mic indicator. If you want to show people what to press, just teach them about it or place the keybind aid next to the icon instead of dispositioning the whole UI to the top).  \n\nP.S. from me personally, I'm a PC player. I don't need every button shown at once. I can just look into the bindings. And even if you want to keep showing the keybindings, do it without moving the indicators around and have and option to just turn them...And why is it green! The default color of VRChat is blue-ish! Feels vibecoded.",
